The most recent version of the Vauxhall Meriva is the second generation (Meriva B), produced from 2010 to 2017. The 'T' in the model name refers to the Turbocharged petrol engine, specifically the 1.4T engine which was available in different power outputs (120PS/118hp and 140PS/138hp) across various trims like Exclusiv, SE, and Design. This evaluation is based on data for the Vauxhall Meriva B with the 1.4T engine.

